<title>NETHERLANDS: NIB 1996 NET PROFIT UP 21.7 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>NIB 1996 NET PROFIT UP 21.7 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    12.84 vs  11.06</p>
<p>    Net profit			   156.0  vs 128.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Nationale Investeringsbank NV (NIB) said in January</p>
<p>it expected a 1996 net profit of more than 150 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  5.50 vs   4.80</p>
<p>    Total income			 364.6  vs 317.1</p>
<p>    Loan loss provision		 50.0  vs  50.0</p>
<p>    Total costs			  161.1  vs 146.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax operating profit	 203.5  vs 170.6</p>
<p>    Tax				     47.4  vs  42.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
